<title>HONG KONG: BankAmerica names new Asia research chief.</title>
<headline>BankAmerica names new Asia research chief.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of America's Global Capital Markets Group said it had appointed Andrew Freris as managing director of Asia research at BA Asia, the bank's Hong Kong-based merchant banking subsidiary.</p>
<p>Prior to joining Bank of America, Freris was director and chief economist at Salomon Brothers (Hong Kong).</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
